---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const categories=[['Servers, storage and networking','Hardware enquiries for infrastructure needs, with compatibility and deployment considerations.'],['Cybersecurity software','Enquiries about endpoint, identity, email and network security options.'],['Endpoint and IT management','Tools for device management, patching, monitoring and IT asset visibility.'],['Cloud and productivity software','Cloud infrastructure, collaboration and productivity licensing enquiries.'],['Backup and disaster recovery','Options for data protection, recovery planning and business continuity.'],['Business software and ERP','Business application enquiries subject to confirmed product availability and scope.']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Technology Products and Partners | Overdott Technologies" description="Enquire about hardware, software, cloud, cybersecurity and business application options. Availability and partner status are verified individually.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="page-width page-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">Products and partner enquiries</p><h1>Find technology that fits your requirements.</h1><p>Tell us what you need to source or evaluate. We can discuss options, compatibility and implementation considerations.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section page-width"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Technology categories</p><h2>Start with what the organization needs to do.</h2><p>This is an enquiry directory, not an online store. Availability, pricing, licensing and sourcing arrangements are confirmed individually.</p></div><div class="directory-grid">{categories.map(([title,description])=><article class="directory-item"><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section section-tint"><div class="page-width split-list"><div class="list-block"><p class="eyebrow">Business software</p><h2>SORA ERP</h2><p>SORA ERP is a potential business software product within the Overdott portfolio. Product availability, features, licensing and implementation details have not been published and must be confirmed before being represented as available.</p></div><div class="list-block"><p class="eyebrow">Partner information</p><h2>Clear about sourcing.</h2><p>No vendor authorization, certification or official distributor status is claimed here. Any relevant vendor or partner arrangement should be verified for the specific product enquiry.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Ask about a product <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="cta-band"><div class="page-width cta-inner"><div><h2>Looking for a specific product or licence?</h2><p>Share the use case, compatibility requirements and quantity you have in mind.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="/contact/">Make a product enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>